NOTE ON DATA / 데이터 고지
The exchange-program data embedded in the HTML files (universities, quotas,
1st-round results) is derived from public notices published by
Pusan National University (부산대학교 국제처). That data remains the property
of its original source and is NOT covered by the MIT license above, which
applies only to the source code of this project. No personal information is
included — 1st-round results are aggregated by university with no student
names, IDs, or departments.
